  <title xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">SSC project in the maritime sector between  Denmark and Ghana  Phase 3</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2" xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">To support a green and sustainable transition and strengthen the framework conditions for the maritime sector in Ghana, through a Strategic Sector Cooperation between the maritime authorities in Ghana and Denmark. 

The project is to contribute in establishing a sustainable shipping environment, favourable prerequisites for a free competition and an international maritime level playing field benefitting both Ghana and Denmark, while at the same time protecting seafarers 

The project also aims to promote and incorporate green solutions and policies, support Ghana&#x2019;s work in Mission Innovation, and supporting Ghana in becoming the first &#x201c;Green Port&#x201d; in West Africa.</narrative>
  </description>
